t type=\"radio\" name=\"renPayMethod\" value=\"cash\" checked class=\"text-amber-500\">\n              <span class=\"text-zinc-200\">Efectivo</span>\n            </label>\n            <label class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 p-2 rounded-xl bg-black/40 border border-white/10 cursor-pointer\">\n              <input type=\"radio\" name=\"renPayMethod\" value=\"card\" class=\"text-amber-500\">\n              <span class=\"text-zinc-200\">Tarjeta</span>\n            </label>\n            <label class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 p-2 rounded-xl bg-black/40 border border-white/10 cursor-pointer\">\n              <input type=\"radio\" name=\"renPayMethod\" value=\"transfer\" class=\"text-amber-500\">\n              <span class=\"text-zinc-200\">Transf.</span>\n            </label>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-300\">\n          Al confirmar, la vigencia se extenderá automáticamente y el torniquete quedará habilitado de inmediato.\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"pt-3 flex items-center justify-end gap-2 border-t border-gym-border/60\">\n          <button onclick=\"closeModal('renewModal')\" class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-gym-surface text-white font-bold\">Cancelar</button>\n          <button onclick=\"confirmRenewal()\" class=\"px-5 py-2 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-black font-black shadow-glow-green\">Confirmar y Cobrar</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ================================================================= -->\n  <!-- CLIENT DATA & JAVASCRIPT LOGIC                                    -->\n  <!-- ================================================================= -->\n  <script>\n    // Initial dataset synchronized with Legends ERP\n    let members = [\n      {\n        id: 'MEM-001',\n        fullName: 'Carlos Mendoza',\n        documentId: '45892011',\n        email: 'carlos.mendoza@email.com',\n        phone: '+52 55 1234 5678',\n        avatarUrl: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=150&q=80',\n        planType: 'vip',\n        planName: 'Membresía Black VIP Anual',\n        price: 9500,\n        status: 'active',\n        daysRemaining: 95,\n        startDate: '2026-01-10',\n        endDate: '2027-01-10',\n        biometricRegistered: true,\n        checkInsCount: 142,\n        totalSpent: 3450,\n        emergency: 'María Mendoza (Esposa) - +52 55 9876 5432',\n        medicalNotes: 'Hipertensión leve controlada. Apto para fuerza.'\n      },\n      {\n        id: 'MEM-002',\n        fullName: 'Valeria Ríos Gómez',\n        documentId: '78291034',\n        email: 'valeria.rios@email.com',\n        phone: '+52 55 4433 2211',\n        avatarUrl: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330?auto=format&fit=crop&w=150&q=80',\n        planType: 'monthly',\n        planName: 'Mensualidad Estándar',\n        price: 850,\n        status: 'active',\n        daysRemaining: 18,\n        startDate: '2026-09-25',\n        endDate: '2026-10-25',\n        biometricRegistered: true,\n        checkInsCount: 28,\n        totalSpent: 1200,\n        emergency: 'Roberto Ríos (Padre) - +52 55 2211 4433',\n        medicalNotes: 'Sin restricciones. Entrenamiento de glúteos e hipertrofia.'\n      },\n      {\n        id: 'MEM-003',\n        fullName: 'Alejandro Soto Vega',\n        documentId: '63901245',\n        email: 'alejandro.soto@email.com',\n        phone: '+52 55 7788 9900',\n        avatarUrl: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=150&q=80',\n        planType: 'quarterly',\n        planName: 'Plan Trimestral Fuerza',\n        price: 2300,\n        status: 'expiring_soon',\n        daysRemaining: 2,\n        startDate: '2026-07-09',\n        endDate: '2026-10-09',\n        biometricRegistered: true,\n        checkInsCount: 56,\n        totalSpent: 2100,\n        emergency: 'Lorena Vega (Hermana) - +52 55 3344 5566',\n        medicalNotes: 'Operación menisco 2023. No sentadillas profundas sin vendaje.'\n      },\n      {\n        id: 'MEM-004',\n        fullName: 'Sofía Domínguez',\n        documentId: '89104523',\n        email: 'sofia.dominguez@email.com',\n        phone: '+52 55 6655 4433',\n        avatarUrl: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517841905240-472988babdf9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=150&q=80',\n        planType: 'monthly',\n        planName: 'Mensualidad Estándar',\n        price: 850,\n        status: 'expired',\n        daysRemaining: -5,\n        startDate: '2026-09-02',\n        endDate: '2026-10-02',\n        biometricRegistered: true,\n        checkInsCount: 19,\n        totalSpent: 650,\n        emergency: 'Andrés Domínguez (Esposo) - +52 55 1199 8877',\n        medicalNotes: 'Alergia a proteína de soya.'\n      },\n      {\n        id: 'MEM-005',\n        fullName: 'Mateo Guerrero',\n        documentId: '32091487',\n        email: 'mateo.guerrero@email.com',\n        phone: '+52 55 9900 1122',\n        avatarUrl: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500648767791-00dcc994a43e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=150&q=80',\n        planType: 'monthly',\n        planName: 'Plan Estudiante Gym',\n        price: 650,\n        status: 'active',\n        daysRemaining: 22,\n        startDate: '2026-09-29',\n        endDate: '2026-10-29',\n        biometricRegistered: true,\n        checkInsCount: 15,\n        totalSpent: 450,\n        emergency: 'Patricia Guerrero (Madre) - +52 55 8822 3344',\n        medicalNotes: 'Acondicionamiento físico general juvenil.'\n      },\n      {\n        id: 'MEM-006',\n        fullName: 'Laura Paredes Ruiz',\n        documentId: '54019283',\n        email: 'laura.paredes@email.com',\n        phone: '+52 55 3322 1100',\n        avatarUrl: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544005313-94ddf0286df2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=150&q=80',\n        planType: 'monthly',\n        planName: 'Mensualidad Estándar',\n        price: 850,\n        status: 'active',\n        daysRemaining: 30,\n        startDate: '2026-10-06',\n        endDate: '2026-11-06',\n        biometricRegistered: true,\n        checkInsCount: 6,\n        totalSpent: 0,\n        emergency: 'Carmen Ruiz (Madre) - +52 55 4411 9988',\n        medicalNotes: 'Sin restricciones.'\n      },\n      {\n        id: 'MEM-007',\n        fullName: 'Diego Alarcón Cruz',\n        documentId: '90812345',\n        email: 'diego.alarcon@email.com',\n        phone: '+52 55 8765 4321',\n        avatarUrl: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1492562080023-ab3db95bfbce?auto=format&fit=crop&w=150&q=80',\n        planType: 'daily',\n        planName: 'Pase por Día (Day Pass)',\n        price: 150,\n        status: 'expired',\n        daysRemaining: -2,\n        startDate: '2026-10-05',\n        endDate: '2026-10-05',\n        biometricRegistered: true,\n        checkInsCount: 4,\n        totalSpent: 180,\n        emergency: 'Gabriel Alarcón (Hermano) - +52 55 7766 5544',\n        medicalNotes: 'Entrenamiento funcional de alta intensidad.'\n      },\n      {\n        id: 'MEM-008',\n        fullName: 'Juan Solis',\n        documentId: '55892018',\n        email: 'juan.solis@email.com',\n        phone: '+52 55 4829 1039',\n        avatarUrl: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522075469751-3a6694fb2f61?auto=format&fit=crop&w=150&q=80',\n        planType: 'monthly',\n        planName: 'Mensualidad Estándar',\n        price: 850,\n        status: 'active',\n        daysRemaining: 30,\n        startDate: '2026-10-13',\n        endDate: '2026-11-13',\n        biometricRegistered: true,\n        checkInsCount: 3,\n        totalSpent: 0,\n        emergency: 'Laura Solis (Hermana) - +52 55 4829 1040',\n        medicalNotes: 'Sin restricciones.'\n      }\n    ];\n\n    let currentStatusFilter = 'all';\n    let currentTierFilter = 'all';\n    let currentSortBy = 'urgency';\n    let currentViewMode = 'table';\n    let currentSearch = '';\n    let activeClientForRenew = null;\n    let activeClientForCred = null;\n\n    // Filter and Sort function\n    function getFilteredMembers() {\n      return members.filter(m => {\n        const q = currentSearch.toLowerCase().trim();\n        const matchesQ = !q || \n          m.fullName.toLowerCase().includes(q) ||\n          m.documentId.toLowerCase().includes(q) ||\n          m.phone.toLowerCase().includes(q) ||\n          m.id.toLowerCase().includes(q) ||\n          m.planName.toLowerCase().includes(q);\n\n        if (!matchesQ) return false;\n\n        const isExpired = m.status === 'expired' || m.daysRemaining < 0;\n        const isExpiring = m.daysRemaining <= 5 && !isExpired;\n        const isActive = m.daysRemaining > 5 && !isExpired;\n\n        if (currentStatusFilter === 'active' && !isActive) return false;\n        if (currentStatusFilter === 'expiring_soon' && !isExpiring) return false;\n        if (currentStatusFilter === 'expired' && !isExpired) return false;\n        if (currentStatusFilter === 'no_fingerprint' && m.biometricRegistered) return false;\n\n        if (currentTierFilter !== 'all') {\n          if (currentTierFilter === 'vip' && m.planType !== 'vip' && !m.planName.toLowerCase().includes('vip')) return false;\n          if (currentTierFilter === 'monthly' && m.planType !== 'monthly') return false;\n          if (currentTierFilter === 'quarterly' && m.planType !== 'quarterly') return false;\n          if (currentTierFilter === 'daily' && m.planType !== 'daily') return false;\n        }\n\n        return true;\n      }).sort((a, b) => {\n        if (currentSortBy === 'urgency') return a.daysRemaining - b.daysRemaining;\n        if (currentSortBy === 'checkins') return (b.checkInsCount || 0) - (a.checkInsCount || 0);\n        if (currentSortBy === 'name') return a.fullName.localeCompare(b.fullName);\n        if (currentSortBy === 'recent') return b.startDate.localeCompare(a.startDate);\n        return 0;\n      });\n    }\n\n    // Update KPI counters\n    function updateKPIs() {\n      const total = members.length;\n      const active = members.filter(m => m.daysRemaining > 5 && m.status !== 'expired').length;\n      const expiring = members.filter(m => m.daysRemaining <= 5 && m.daysRemaining >= 0 && m.status !== 'expired').length;\n      const expired = members.filter(m => m.status === 'expired' || m.daysRemaining < 0).length;\n      const noFp = members.filter(m => !m.biometricRegistered).length;\n\n      document.getElementById('kpiTotalNum').innerText = total;\n      document.getElementById('kpiActiveNum').innerText = active;\n      document.getElementById('kpiExpiringNum').innerText = expiring;\n      document.getElementById('kpiExpiredNum').innerText = expired;\n      document.getElementById('kpiNoFpNum').innerText = noFp;\n\n      document.getElementById('tabCount-all').innerText = total;\n      document.getElementById('tabCount-active').innerText = active;\n      document.getElementById('tabCount-expiring_soon').innerText = expiring;\n      document.getElementById('tabCount-expired').innerText = expired;\n      document.getElementById('tabCount-no_fingerprint').innerText = noFp;\n    }\n\n    // Set Status Filter\n    function setStatusFilter(filter) {\n      audio.playBlip();\n      currentStatusFilter = filter;\n      \n      // Update Tab Styles\n      ['all', 'active', 'expiring_soon', 'expired', 'no_fingerprint'].forEach(f => {\n        const btn = document.getElementById(`tab-${f}`);\n        const kpi = document.getElementById(`kpi-${f}`);\n        if (f === filter) {\n          btn.className = 'px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold transition-all bg-amber-500 text-black shadow-md';\n          if (kpi) kpi.classList.add('ring-2', 'ring-amber-500/40', 'border-amber-500');\n        } else {\n          btn.className = 'px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold transition-all text-gym-muted hover:text-white';\n          if (kpi) kpi.classList.remove('ring-2', 'ring-amber-500/40', 'border-amber-500');\n        }\n      });\n\n      render();\n    }\n\n    function handleTierChange(val) {\n      audio.playBlip();\n      currentTierFilter = val;\n      render();\n    }\n\n    function handleSortChange(val) {\n      audio.playBlip();\n      currentSortBy = val;\n      render();\n    }\n\n    function handleSearch(val) {\n      currentSearch = val;\n      document.getElementById('clearSearchBtn').style.display = val ? 'block' : 'none';\n      render();\n    }\n\n    function clearSearch() {\n      document.getElementById('searchInput').value = '';\n      currentSearch = '';\n      document.getElementById('clearSearchBtn').style.display = 'none';\n      render();\n    }\n\n    function setViewMode(mode) {\n      audio.playBlip();\n      currentViewMode = mode;\n      \n      const bTable = document.getElementById('btnViewTable');\n      const bGrid = document.getElementById('btnViewGrid');\n      const bDesk = document.getElementById('btnViewDesk');\n\n      bTable.className = mode === 'table' ? 'p-1.5 rounded-lg transition-all flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold bg-amber-500 text-black shadow-md' : 'p-1.5 rounded-lg transition-all flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-gym-muted hover:text-white';\n      bGrid.className = mode === 'grid' ? 'p-1.5 rounded-lg transition-all flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold bg-amber-500 text-black shadow-md' : 'p-1.5 rounded-lg transition-all flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-gym-muted hover:text-white';\n      bDesk.className = mode === 'desk' ? 'p-1.5 rounded-lg transition-all flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold bg-amber-500 text-black shadow-md' : 'p-1.5 rounded-lg transition-all flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-gym-muted hover:text-white';\n\n      render();\n    }\n\n    // Quick Gate Simulator\n    function simulateAccess(id) {\n      const member = members.find(m => m.id === id);\n      if (!member) return;\n\n      const isExpired = member.status === 'expired' || member.daysRemaining < 0;\n\n      const toast = document.getElementById('accessToast');\n      const icon = document.getElementById('toastIcon');\n      const title = document.getElementById('toastTitle');\n      const body = document.getElementById('toastBody');\n\n      if (!isExpired) {\n        audio.playGranted();\n        member.checkInsCount = (member.checkInsCount || 0) + 1;\n        updateKPIs();\n\n        toast.className = 'fixed top-5 right-5 z-50 transform translate-y-0 transition-transform duration-300 p-4 rounded-2xl border shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md max-w-md flex items-start gap-3 bg-[#0b1d14]/95 border-emerald-500/60 shadow-emerald-500/20 text-white';\n        icon.className = 'p-2 rounded-xl shrink-0 bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 font-black text-lg';\n        icon.innerText = '✓';\n        title.innerHTML = `<span>${member.fullName}</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-black/40 text-emerald-400\">PASE AUTORIZADO</span>`;\n        body.innerText = `¡Torniquete 1 Abierto! ${member.planName} • Visita #${member.checkInsCount}`;\n      } else {\n        audio.playDenied();\n        toast.className = 'fixed top-5 right-5 z-50 transform translate-y-0 transition-transform duration-300 p-4 rounded-2xl border shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md max-w-md flex items-start gap-3 bg-[#21090a]/95 border-red-500/60 shadow-red-500/20 text-white';\n        icon.className = 'p-2 rounded-xl shrink-0 bg-red-500/20 text-red-400 font-black text-lg';\n        icon.innerText = '✕';\n        title.innerHTML = `<span>${member.fullName}</span><span class=\"text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-black/40 text-red-400\">ACCESO DENEGADO</span>`;\n        body.innerText = `Membresía vencida hace ${Math.abs(member.daysRemaining)} días. Favor de renovar en recepción.`;\n      }\n\n      setTimeout(() => {\n        toast.className = 'fixed top-5 right-5 z-50 transform translate-y-[-150%] transition-transform duration-300 p-4 rounded-2xl border shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md max-w-md flex items-start gap-3';\n      }, 4000);\n\n      render();\n    }\n\n    // Direct WhatsApp message\n    function sendWhatsApp(id) {\n      const member = members.find(m => m.id === id);\n      if (!member || !member.phone) return;\n\n      const isExpired = member.status === 'expired' || member.daysRemaining < 0;\n      const isExpiring = member.daysRemaining <= 5 && !isExpired;\n\n      let msg = '';\n      if (isExpired) {\n        msg = `Hola ${member.fullName}! Te saludamos de Legends Pro Gym. Notamos que tu membresia (${member.planName}) vencio hace ${Math.abs(member.daysRemaining)} dias. Te extrañamos en el gym! Puedes pasar a recepcion a renovar hoy mismo.`;\n      } else if (isExpiring) {\n        msg = `Hola ${member.fullName}! Te recordamos cordialmente de Legends Pro Gym que tu membresia (${member.planName}) vence en ${member.daysRemaining} dias (${member.endDate}). Pasa a recepcion a renovar y asegura tu acceso continuo!`;\n      } else {\n        msg = `Hola ${member.fullName}! Te saludamos de Legends Pro Gym. Tu membresia (${member.planName}) esta activa y vigente. Necesitas apoyo de un entrenador o tienes alguna consulta? Estamos a tu orden!`;\n      }\n\n      window.open(`https://wa.me/${member.phone.replace(/\\D/g, '')}?text=${encodeURIComponent(msg)}`, '_blank');\n    }\n\n    // Open Credential Modal\n    function openCredential(id) {\n      audio.playBlip();\n      const member = members.find(m => m.id === id);\n      if (!member) return;\n      activeClientForCred = member;\n\n      document.getElementById('credAvatar').src = member.avatarUrl;\n      document.getElementById('credName').innerText = member.fullName;\n      document.getElementById('credId').innerText = member.id;\n      document.getElementById('credDni').innerText = member.documentId;\n      document.getElementById('credPlan').innerText = member.planName;\n      document.getElementById('credEnd').innerText = member.endDate;\n      document.getElementById('credBarcodeText').innerText = `*${member.id}*`;\n\n      const isVip = member.planType === 'vip' || member.planName.toLowerCase().includes('vip');\n      document.getElementById('credBadgeVip').innerText = isVip ? '👑 BLACK VIP' : 'MEMBER PASS';\n\n      // Barcode lines generator\n      const barcodeContainer = document.getElementById('barcodeLines');\n      barcodeContainer.innerHTML = '';\n      for (let i = 0; i < 38; i++) {\n        const line = document.createElement('div');\n        const w = (i % 3 === 0) ? '3px' : (i % 2 === 0) ? '2px' : '1px';\n        line.style.width = w;\n        line.style.backgroundColor = '#000';\n        barcodeContainer.appendChild(line);\n      }\n\n      document.getElementById('credentialModal').classList.remove('hidden');\n    }\n\n    function shareCredViaWhatsApp() {\n      if (!activeClientForCred) return;\n      const text = `🏋️ *FITNESS LEGENDS PRO GYM* 🏋️\\n*Credencial Digital Oficial*\\n👤 Socio: ${activeClientForCred.fullName}\\n🆔 ID: ${activeClientForCred.id}\\n⭐ Plan: ${activeClientForCred.planName}\\n📅 Vigencia: ${activeClientForCred.endDate}\\n🔒 Acceso: Torniquetes Biométricos Habilitados`;\n      window.open(`https://wa.me/${activeClientForCred.phone.replace(/\\D/g, '')}?text=${encodeURIComponent(text)}`, '_blank');\n    }\n\n    // Open Detail Modal\n    function openDetail(id) {\n      audio.playBlip();\n      const member = members.find(m => m.id === id);\n      if (!member) return;\n\n      document.getElementById('detAvatar').src = member.avatarUrl;\n      document.getElementById('detName').innerText = member.fullName;\n      document.getElementById('detIdBadge').innerText = member.id;\n      document.getElementById('detDni').innerText = member.documentId;\n      document.getElementById('detCreated').innerText = member.startDate;\n      document.getElementById('detPlanName').innerText = `${member.planName} • $${member.price} MXN`;\n      document.getElementById('detPhone').innerText = member.phone;\n      document.getElementById('detEmail').innerText = member.email;\n      document.getElementById('detCheckins').innerText = `${member.checkInsCount} ingresos`;\n      document.getElementById('detSpent').innerText = `$${member.totalSpent} MXN`;\n      document.getElementById('detEmergency').innerText = member.emergency;\n      document.getElementById('detMedical').innerText = member.medicalNotes;\n\n      document.getElementById('detailModal').classList.remove('hidden');\n    }\n\n    // Open Renew Modal\n    function openRenew(id) {\n      audio.playBlip();\n      const member = members.find(m => m.id === id);\n      if (!member) return;\n      activeClientForRenew = member;\n\n      document.getElementById('renMemberName').innerText = member.fullName;\n      document.getElementById('renMemberPlan').innerText = `Plan actual: ${member.planName} (${member.daysRemaining} días restantes)`;\n      document.getElementById('renewModal').classList.remove('hidden');\n    }\n\n    function confirmRenewal() {\n      if (!activeClientForRenew) return;\n      const planVal = document.getElementById('renPlanSelect').value;\n      \n      let addDays = 30;\n      let planName = 'Mensualidad Estándar';\n      let price = 850;\n\n      if (planVal === 'vip') { addDays = 365; planName = 'Membresía Black VIP Anual'; price = 9500; }\n      if (planVal === 'quarterly') { addDays = 90; planName = 'Plan Trimestral Fuerza'; price = 2300; }\n      if (planVal === 'daily') { addDays = 1; planName = 'Pase por Día'; price = 150; }\n\n      activeClientForRenew.daysRemaining = Math.max(0, activeClientForRenew.daysRemaining) + addDays;\n      activeClientForRenew.status = 'active';\n      activeClientForRenew.planName = planName;\n      activeClientForRenew.price = price;\n      \n      const now = new Date();\n      now.setDate(now.getDate() + activeClientForRenew.daysRemaining);\n      activeClientForRenew.endDate = now.toISOString().slice(0, 10);\n\n      audio.playGranted();\n      closeModal('renewModal');\n      updateKPIs();\n      render();\n\n      alert(`✅ ¡Membresía renovada con éxito!\\nSocio: ${activeClientForRenew.fullName}\\nNuevo vencimiento: ${activeClientForRenew.endDate}\\nTorniquete habilitado.`);\n    }\n\n    function openNewClientModal() {\n      audio.playBlip();\n      document.getElementById('newClientModal').classList.remove('hidden');\n    }\n\n    function handleCreateClient(e) {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      const fullName = document.getElementById('newFullName').value;\n      const docId = document.getElementById('newDocId').value;\n      const phone = document.getElementById('newPhone').value;\n      const planType = document.getElementById('newPlanSelect').value;\n\n      let planName = 'Mensualidad Estándar';\n      let price = 850;\n      let days = 30;\n      if (planType === 'vip') { planName = 'Membresía Black VIP Anual'; price = 9500; days = 365; }\n      if (planType === 'quarterly') { planName = 'Plan Trimestral Fuerza'; price = 2300; days = 90; }\n      if (planType === 'daily') { planName = 'Pase por Día'; price = 150; days = 1; }\n\n      const newId = `MEM-00${members.length + 1}`;\n      const now = new Date();\n      const startStr = now.toISOString().slice(0, 10);\n      now.setDate(now.getDate() + days);\n      const endStr = now.toISOString().slice(0, 10);\n\n      const newMember = {\n        id: newId,\n        fullName: fullName.trim(),\n        documentId: docId.trim(),\n        phone: phone.trim(),\n        email: `${fullName.toLowerCase().replace(/\\s+/g, '.')}@email.com`,\n        avatarUrl: 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=150&q=80',\n        planType,\n        planName,\n        price,\n        status: 'active',\n        daysRemaining: days,\n        startDate: startStr,\n        endDate: endStr,\n        biometricRegistered: true,\n        checkInsCount: 0,\n        totalSpent: 0,\n        emergency: 'Familiar directo - ' + phone,\n        medicalNotes: 'Apto para actividad física.'\n      };\n\n      members.unshift(newMember);\n      audio.playGranted();\n      closeModal('newClientModal');\n      updateKPIs();\n      render();\n\n      alert(`🎉 ¡Socio ${fullName} registrado e inscrito exitosamente!\\nID: ${newId}\\nHuella y acceso al torniquete habilitados.`);\n    }\n\n    function deleteMember(id) {\n      if (confirm(`¿Estás seguro de eliminar el socio ${id}?`)) {\n        members = members.filter(m => m.id !== id);\n        updateKPIs();\n        render();\n      }\n    }\n\n    function closeModal(id) {\n      document.getElementById(id).classList.add('hidden');\n    }\n\n    // Excel Export with SheetJS\n    function exportToExcel() {\n      const list = getFilteredMembers();\n      const rows = list.map(m => ({\n        'ID Socio': m.id,\n        'Nombre': m.fullName,\n        'DNI': m.documentId,\n        'Teléfono': m.phone,\n        'Correo': m.email,\n        'Plan': m.planName,\n        'Precio MXN': m.price,\n        'Vigencia Fin': m.endDate,\n        'Días Restantes': m.daysRemaining,\n        'Estado': m.daysRemaining < 0 ? 'VENCIDA' : m.daysRemaining <= 5 ? 'POR VENCER' : 'ACTIVA',\n        'Huella Enrolada': m.biometricRegistered ? 'SÍ' : 'NO',\n        'Asistencias': m.checkInsCount\n      }));\n\n      const ws = XLSX.utils.json_to_sheet(rows);\n      const wb = XLSX.utils.book_new();\n      XLSX.utils.book_append_sheet(wb, ws, \"Socios_Legends\");\n      XLSX.writeFile(wb, `Cartera_Clientes_LegendsGym_${new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10)}.xlsx`);\n    }\n\n    // Main Render Function\n    function render() {\n      const container = document.getElementById('mainContainer');\n      const list = getFilteredMembers();\n\n      if (list.length === 0) {\n        container.innerHTML = `\n          <div class=\"bg-[#12131a] rounded-3xl border border-gym-border p-14 text-center\">\n            <div class=\"w-14 h-14 mx-auto mb-3 text-amber-500/40 text-4xl\">👥</div>\n            <h3 class=\"font-extrabold text-white text-lg\">No se encontraron clientes</h3>\n            <p class=\"text-xs text-gym-muted mt-1 max-w-md mx-auto\">\n              No hay socios que coincidan con la búsqueda o filtro seleccionado.\n            </p>\n            <button onclick=\"clearSearch(); setStatusFilter('all')\" class=\"mt-4 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-gym-surface text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/30 text-xs font-bold\">\n              Restablecer Filtros\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        `;\n        return;\n      }\n\n      // VIEW 1: TABLA INTELIGENTE (THE REQUESTED TABLE ELEVATED)\n      if (currentViewMode === 'table') {\n        let html = `\n          <div class=\"bg-[#101117] rounded-3xl border border-gym-border/90 overflow-hidden shadow-2xl\">\n            <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n              <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse\">\n                <thead>\n                  <tr class=\"border-b border-gym-border bg-[#141520] text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-400\">\n                    <th class=\"p-4 pl-5\">Socio</th>\n                    <th class=\"p-4\">Contacto Directo</th>\n                    <th class=\"p-4\">Membresía / Plan</th>\n                    <th class=\"p-4\">Estado & Vigencia</th>\n                    <th class=\"p-4 text-center\">Acceso Huella</th>\n                    <th class=\"p-4 pr-5 text-right\">Acciones Rápidas</th>\n                  </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-gym-border/50 text-sm\">\n        `;\n\n        list.forEach(m => {\n          const isExpired = m.status === 'expired' || m.daysRemaining < 0;\n          const isExpiring = m.daysRemaining <= 5 && !isExpired;\n          const isVip = m.planType === 'vip' || m.planName.toLowerCase().includes('vip');\n\n          const statusBadge = isExpired \n            ? '<span class=\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full border bg-red-500/20 text-red-400 border-red-500/40\">VENCIDA</span>'\n            : isExpiring \n            ? '<span class=\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full border bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 border-amber-500/40\">POR VENCER</span>'\n            : '<span class=\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full border bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 border-emerald-500/40\">ACTIVA</span>';\n\n          const daysText = isExpired\n            ? `<span class=\"text-red-400 font-bold font-mono\">Venció hace ${Math.abs(m.daysRemaining)} d</span>`\n            : isExpiring\n            ? `<span class=\"text-amber-400 font-bold font-mono\">${m.daysRemaining} d restantes</span>`\n            : `<span class=\"text-emerald-400 font-bold font-mono\">${m.daysRemaining} d restantes</span>`;\n\n          const barColor = isExpired ? 'bg-red-500 w-full' : isExpiring ? 'bg-amber-400 w-1/4 animate-pulse' : 'bg-emerald-400 w-3/4';\n          const avatarHalo = isExpired ? 'border-red-500 ring-2 ring-red-500/30' : isExpiring ? 'border-amber-400 ring-2 ring-amber-400/30' : 'border-emerald-400 ring-2 ring-emerald-400/30';\n\n          html += `\n            <tr class=\"hover:bg-white/[0.025] transition-colors group\">\n              <!-- SOCIO -->\n              <td class=\"p-4 pl-5\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\">\n                  <div class=\"relative shrink-0 cursor-pointer\" onclick=\"openDetail('${m.id}')\">\n                    <img src=\"${m.avatarUrl}\" class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-2xl object-cover border-2 shadow-md transition-transform group-hover:scale-105 ${avatarHalo}\" alt=\"Avatar\">\n                    ${isVip ? '<span class=\"absolute -top-1.5 -right-1.5 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-400 to-amber-600 flex items-center justify-center text-black text-[10px] shadow-sm font-black\" title=\"Socio Black VIP\">👑</span>' : ''}\n                  </div>\n                  <div>\n                    <div onclick=\"openDetail('${m.id}')\" class=\"font-black text-white hover:text-amber-400 cursor-pointer text-sm leading-tight transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n                      <span>${m.fullName}</span>\n                      ${isVip ? '<span class=\"text-[9px] font-black uppercase px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/30\">VIP</span>' : ''}\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-gym-muted font-mono mt-1\">\n                      <span class=\"bg-black/40 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-zinc-300 font-bold border border-white/5\">ID: ${m.id}</span>\n                      <span>•</span>\n                      <span class=\"text-zinc-400\">DNI: ${m.documentId}</span>\n                    </div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </td>\n\n              <!-- CONTACTO -->\n              <td class=\"p-4\">\n                <div class=\"space-y-1 text-xs\">\n                  <button onclick=\"sendWhatsApp('${m.id}')\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300 font-semibold bg-emerald-500/10 hover:bg-emerald-500/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/20 transition-colors\" title=\"Enviar WhatsApp con mensaje automático\">\n                    <span>📱</span>\n                    <span>${m.phone}</span>\n                  </button>\n                  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-zinc-400 text-[11px] truncate max-w-[190px]\">\n                    <span>✉️</span>\n                    <span class=\"truncate\">${m.email}</span>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </td>\n\n              <!-- PLAN -->\n              <td class=\"p-4\">\n                <div class=\"font-extrabold text-white text-xs leading-tight\">${m.planName}</div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1\">\n                  <span class=\"text-amber-400 font-black font-mono text-xs\">$${m.price.toLocaleString()} MXN</span>\n                  <span class=\"text-[10px] text-zinc-400 font-mono\">(${m.planType})</span>\n                </div>\n              </td>\n\n              <!-- ESTADO & VIGENCIA -->\n              <td class=\"p-4\">\n                <div class=\"space-y-1.5 max-w-[190px]\">\n                  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    ${statusBadge}\n                    ${daysText}\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"w-full bg-zinc-800 rounded-full h-1.5 overflow-hidden\">\n                    <div class=\"h-full rounded-full ${barColor}\"></div>\n                  </div>\n                  <span class=\"text-[10px] text-zinc-400 font-mono block\">Hasta: ${m.endDate}</span>\n                </div>\n              </td>\n\n              <!-- HUELLA -->\n              <td class=\"p-4 text-center\">\n                <div class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center\">\n                  <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/15 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-bold\">\n                    <span>🔒</span>\n                    <span>Enrolada</span>\n                  </div>\n                  <span class=\"text-[10px] text-zinc-400 font-mono mt-1\">${m.checkInsCount} visitas</span>\n                </div>\n              </td>\n\n              <!-- ACCIONES -->\n              <td class=\"p-4 pr-5 text-right\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-end gap-1.5\">\n                  <button onclick=\"simulateAccess('${m.id}')\" class=\"p-2 rounded-xl bg-gym-surface hover:bg-amber-500/20 text-zinc-300 hover:text-amber-400 border border-gym-border transition-colors\" title=\"⚡ Simular Pase / Abrir Torniquete\">\n                    🚪\n                  </button>\n                  <button onclick=\"openCredential('${m.id}')\" class=\"p-2 rounded-xl bg-gym-surface hover:bg-white/10 text-zinc-300 hover:text-white border border-gym-border transition-colors\" title=\"Credencial Digital con QR & Barcode\">\n                    🆔\n                  </button>\n                  <button onclick=\"openDetail('${m.id}')\" class=\"p-2 rounded-xl bg-gym-surface hover:bg-white/10 text-zinc-300 hover:text-white border border-gym-border transition-colors\" title=\"Ver Expediente Completo\">\n                    👁️\n                  </button>\n                  <button onclick=\"openRenew('${m.id}')\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/20 hover:bg-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-bold border border-emerald-500/40 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1 shadow-sm\" title=\"Renovar membresía\">\n                    <span>🔄</span>\n                    <span class=\"hidden xl:inline\">Renovar</span>\n                  </button>\n                  <button onclick=\"deleteMember('${m.id}')\" class=\"p-2 rounded-xl bg-gym-surface hover:bg-red-500/20 text-zinc-400 hover:text-red-400 border border-gym-border transition-colors\" title=\"Eliminar socio\">\n                    🗑️\n                  </button>\n                </div>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          `;\n        });\n\n        html += `\n                </tbody>\n              </table>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        `;\n        container.innerHTML = html;\n      }\n\n      // VIEW 2: FICHAS PRO (CARDS GRID)\n      else if (currentViewMode === 'grid') {\n        let html = `<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4 2xl:grid-cols-5 gap-4\">`;\n        list.forEach(m => {\n          const isExpired = m.status === 'expired' || m.daysRemaining < 0;\n          const isExpiring = m.daysRemaining <= 5 && !isExpired;\n          const isVip = m.planType === 'vip' || m.planName.toLowerCase().includes('vip');\n\n          html += `\n            <div class=\"group relative rounded-3xl border p-4 transition-all duration-300 shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl flex flex-col justify-between ${isVip ? 'bg-gradient-to-b from-[#1c1608] via-[#12131b] to-[#0c0d12] border-amber-500/40' : 'bg-[#12131a] hover:bg-[#161722] border-gym-border'}\">\n              <div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3\">\n                  <span class=\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full border ${isExpired ? 'bg-red-500/20 text-red-400 border-red-500/30' : isExpiring ? 'bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 border-amber-500/30' : 'bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 border-emerald-500/30'}\">\n                    ${isExpired ? 'Vencida' : isExpiring ? 'Por Vencer' : 'Activa'}\n                  </span>\n                  <span class=\"text-[11px] text-emerald-400 font-bold bg-emerald-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/20\">\n                    🔒 Huella OK\n                  </span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5 mb-3.5\">\n                  <div class=\"relative shrink-0\" onclick=\"openDetail('${m.id}')\">\n                    <img src=\"${m.avatarUrl}\" class=\"w-13 h-13 rounded-2xl object-cover border-2 shadow-md ${isExpired ? 'border-red-500' : isExpiring ? 'border-amber-400' : 'border-emerald-400'}\" style=\"width:52px; height:52px;\">\n                    ${isVip ? '<span class=\"absolute -top-1.5 -right-1.5 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px]\">👑</span>' : ''}\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\">\n                    <h4 onclick=\"openDetail('${m.id}')\" class=\"font-extrabold text-white text-sm hover:text-amber-400 cursor-pointer truncate\">${m.fullName}</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-[11px] text-gym-muted font-mono mt-0.5\">ID: ${m.id} • DNI: ${m.documentId}</p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"bg-[#181924]/80 rounded-2xl p-3 border border-white/5 mb-3 space-y-1.5\">\n                  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs\">\n                    <span class=\"font-bold text-white truncate max-w-[65%]\">${m.planName}</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-amber-400 font-black font-mono text-xs\">$${m.price.toLocaleString()}</span>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-gym-muted\">\n                    <span>Vigencia:</span>\n                    <span class=\"font-bold font-mono ${isExpired ? 'text-red-400' : isExpiring ? 'text-amber-400' : 'text-emerald-400'}\">\n                      ${isExpired ? `Venció hace ${Math.abs(m.daysRemaining)} d` : `${m.daysRemaining} días`}\n                    </span>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"w-full bg-zinc-800 rounded-full h-1.5 overflow-hidden\">\n                    <div class=\"h-full rounded-full ${isExpired ? 'bg-red-500 w-full' : isExpiring ? 'bg-amber-400 w-1/4' : 'bg-emerald-400 w-3/4'}\"></div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-zinc-400 px-1 mb-2\">\n                  <span class=\"font-mono\">⚡ ${m.checkInsCount} visitas</span>\n                  <button onclick=\"sendWhatsApp('${m.id}')\" class=\"text-emerald-400 hover:underline\">💬 WhatsApp</button>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"border-t border-white/10 pt-2.5 mt-2 flex items-center justify-between\">\n                <button onclick=\"openDetail('${m.id}')\" class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300\">Expediente &rarr;</button>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n                  <button onclick=\"simulateAccess('${m.id}')\" class=\"p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-gym-surface hover:bg-amber-500/20 text-zinc-300 hover:text-amber-400 border border-gym-border\" title=\"Simular Torniquete\">🚪</button>\n                  <button onclick=\"openCredential('${m.id}')\" class=\"p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-gym-surface hover:bg-white/10 text-zinc-300 hover:text-white border border-gym-border\" title=\"Credencial\">🆔</button>\n                  <button onclick=\"openRenew('${m.id}')\" class=\"p-1.5 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/20 hover:bg-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30\" title=\"Renovar\">🔄</button>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          `;\n        });\n        html += `</div>`;\n        container.innerHTML = html;\n      }\n\n      // VIEW 3: MESA DE RENOVACIONES (URGENCY FOLLOW-UP)\n      else if (currentViewMode === 'desk') {\n        const urgentList = list.filter(m => m.daysRemaining <= 5 || m.status === 'expired');\n\n        if (urgentList.length === 0) {\n          container.innerHTML = `\n            <div class=\"bg-[#12131a] rounded-3xl border border-gym-border p-12 text-center\">\n              <div class=\"text-4xl mb-3\">🎉</div>\n              <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black text-white\">¡No hay membresías vencidas ni por vencer!</h3>\n              <p class=\"text-xs text-gym-muted mt-1\">Todos los socios en este filtro están con vigencia superior a 5 días.</p>\n            </div>\n          `;\n          return;\n        }\n\n        let html = `\n          <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n            <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 flex items-center gap-3\">\n              <span class=\"text-2xl\">⚡</span>\n              <div class=\"text-xs text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed\">\n                <strong class=\"text-white\">Mesa de Seguimiento & Cobranza Prioritaria:</strong> Aquí se concentran los socios cuyo acceso está bloqueado o por vencer en menos de 5 días. Pulsa en <strong>Aviso WhatsApp</strong> para abrir la conversación con el recordatorio listo para enviar.\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\">\n        `;\n\n        urgentList.forEach(m => {\n          const isExpired = m.status === 'expired' || m.daysRemaining < 0;\n\n          html += `\n            <div class=\"p-5 rounded-3xl border shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-between ${isExpired ? 'bg-gradient-to-br from-[#230f12] via-[#141015] to-[#0c0d12] border-red-500/40' : 'bg-gradient-to-br from-[#241a0d] via-[#151318] to-[#0c0d12] border-amber-500/40'}\">\n              <div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\">\n                  <span class=\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full ${isExpired ? 'bg-red-500 text-white' : 'bg-amber-400 text-black'}\">\n                    ${isExpired ? 'Acceso Bloqueado' : 'Próximo a Vencer'}\n                  </span>\n                  <span class=\"text-xs font-black font-mono ${isExpired ? 'text-red-400' : 'text-amber-400'}\">\n                    ${isExpired ? `Venció hace ${Math.abs(m.daysRemaining)} días` : `Vence en ${m.daysRemaining} días`}\n                  </span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\">\n                  <img src=\"${m.avatarUrl}\" class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl object-cover border border-white/20\">\n                  <div>\n                    <h4 class=\"font-black text-white text-base leading-tight\">${m.fullName}</h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400 font-mono\">DNI: ${m.documentId} • ID: ${m.id}</p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"p-3 bg-black/40 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 space-y-1 text-xs mb-4\">\n                  <div class=\"flex justify-between\">\n                    <span class=\"text-gym-muted\">Plan Actual:</span>\n                    <span class=\"font-bold text-white\">${m.planName}</span>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"flex justify-between\">\n                    <span class=\"text-gym-muted\">Costo Renovación:</span>\n                    <span class=\"font-black text-amber-400 font-mono\">$${m.price.toLocaleString()} MXN</span>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"flex justify-between\">\n                    <span class=\"text-gym-muted\">Vigencia Fin:</span>\n                    <span class=\"font-mono text-zinc-300\">${m.endDate}</span>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 pt-2 border-t border-white/10\">\n                <button onclick=\"sendWhatsApp('${m.id}')\" class=\"flex-1 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-black font-black text-xs flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 transition-all shadow-md\">\n                  <span>💬</span>\n                  <span>Aviso WhatsApp</span>\n                </button>\n                <button onclick=\"openRenew('${m.id}')\" class=\"px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-black font-black text-xs flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 transition-all shadow-glow-gold\">\n                  <span>🔄</span>\n                  <span>Renovar</span>\n                </button>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          `;\n        });\n\n        html += `</div></div>`;\n        container.innerHTML = html;\n      }\n    }\n\n    // Initialize on page load\n    updateKPIs();\n    render();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"c:\\Users\\andre\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\gym\\CARTERA_CLIENTES_INTERFAZ_PRO.html"}}]}
