{"step_index":219,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-24T15:45:24Z","input_tokens":5548,"cache_read_tokens":166861,"output_tokens":1180,"thinking":"The layout uses `flex-col` and `lg:flex-row`, causing a responsive design issue on larger screens within the specified resolution range. The elements are forced horizontally due to `flex-nowrap`, leading to the observed squeezing of UI components.\n\n\nInitial hypothesis: The \"quiero verlo completo\" request indicates a need to ensure all UI elements are visible without clipping, particularly focusing on the table and filter controls. The current layout's `flex-col` and `flex-row` behavior, combined with `flex-nowrap`, appears to be the root cause of the overflow.\n\nSpecific observations: Filter tabs are squished, the action buttons in the table overflow, and the overall container constraints are not providing adequate space. The `max-w-7xl` and padding configurations may be contributing to the problem rather than solving it.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"EndLine":100,"Path":"C:\\Users\\andre\\.gemini\\antigravity\\builtin\\skills\\generative_ui\\SKILL.md","StartLine":1}}]}
{"step_index":220,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-24T15:45:32Z","content":"Created At: 2026-10-24T09:45:32-06:00\nCompleted At: 2026-10-24T09:45:33-06:00\nShowing lines 1-100 of 123\n1: ---\n2: name: generative_ui\n3: description: How to render rich interactive HTML widgets inline in the chat or as standalone artifacts. Use this skill when you want to show the user diagrams, data visualizations, interactive controls, educational walkthroughs, or any rich visual content beyond plain text and markdown.\n4: ---\n5: \n6: # Generative UI\n7: \n8: You can render custom, rich, interactive user interfaces (inline widgets or\n9: larger artifacts) directly in the chat. This is a great way to communicate\n10: complex information to the user, generate rich visualizations, and even create\n11: small interactive experiences for the user.\n12: \n13: ## Workflow\n14: \n15: 1.  **Create the HTML Artifact**: Use `write_to_file` to save a self-contained\n16:     `.html` file (using Tailwind CSS and inline JavaScript) to the artifact\n17:     directory. Set `UserFacing: true` in `ArtifactMetadata`.\n18: 2.  **Embed Inline (optional)**: Include the `<agent-embed>` tag in your chat\n19:     response, if you decide this html artifact should be rendered inline in the\n20:     conversation:\n21: \n22:     ```\n23:     <agent-embed src=\"file:///<artifact_path>/widget.html\"></agent-embed>\n24:     ```\n25: \n26: ## Constraints & Theming\n27: \n28: *   **External Assets & Tailwind CSS**: All external CDNs are blocked by CSP,\n29:     except for one allowlisted gstatic Tailwind dependency that you **CAN** and\n30:     **SHOULD** use to style your artifacts. Include the following script tag in\n31:     your `<head>` to enable Tailwind:\n32: \n33:     ```html\n34:     <script src=\"https://www.gstatic.com/antigravity/web/dev/tailwindcss.min.js\"></script>\n35:     ```\n36: \n37: *   **Use Provided Theme Variables**: The iframe injects the app's semantic\n38:     design-system tokens, so widgets automatically match the host theme and the\n39:     user's custom colors. Surfaces (`--background`, `--content`, `--card`,\n40:     `--sidebar`), borders (`--border`), text (`--foreground`,\n41:     `--muted-foreground`, `--placeholder`), and accents\n42:     (`--primary`/`--primary-foreground`, `--secondary`/`--secondary-foreground`,\n43:     `--accent`) are all available. Typography is applied for you on the document\n44:     body — you do not need to set a font, and never use sub-12px micro-text\n45:     (`text-[10px]`, `text-[11px]`, or CSS `font-size` below `12px`; keep\n46:     `text-xs` / `12px` as the minimum floor unless the user asks).\n47: \n48: *   **Text & Surface Colors**: Use semantic variables (`bg-[var(--card)]`,\n49:     `text-[var(--foreground)]`, `text-[var(--muted-foreground)]`)\n50:     instead of hardcoded dark/light utility classes (e.g., `bg-slate-900`,\n51:     `text-white`) to ensure high contrast across both light and dark themes.\n52: \n53: *   **Do Not Declare Local Fallbacks on `:root`**: Never define local color\n54:     fallbacks on `:root` in a `<style>` block; the host environment manages\n55:     theme variables dynamically.\n56: \n57: *   **HTML Boilerplate Template**: Recommended base template:\n58: \n59:     ```html\n60:     <!DOCTYPE html>\n61:     <html>\n62:     <head>\n63:       <script src=\"https://www.gstatic.com/antigravity/web/dev/tailwindcss.min.js\"></script>\n64:     </head>\n65:     <body class=\"bg-transparent text-[var(--foreground)] antialiased p-5\">\n66:       <div class=\"bg-[var(--card)] text-[var(--foreground)] border border-[var(--border)] rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm\">\n67:         <h2 class=\"text-[var(--foreground)] font-semibold text-lg\">Title</h2>\n68:         <p class=\"text-[var(--muted-foreground)] text-sm\">Description</p>\n69:         <!-- Interactive content goes here -->\n70:       </div>\n71:     </body>\n72:     </html>\n73:     ```\n74: \n75: *   **General styling**: Aim for a clean, premium aesthetic. For `<canvas>`,\n76:     check `document.documentElement.classList.contains('light')` to adapt\n77:     colors.\n78: \n79: ## Deciding on Placement (Inline vs. Standalone)\n80: \n81: **Default to artifact only** — reference the HTML artifact in your response and\n82: let the user open it in the side pane. Consider inlining when the widget is\n83: compact (comfortably under 500px tall) and directly illustrates the surrounding\n84: explanation (e.g., a small educational widget, plot, or diagram). Larger, more\n85: complex content (data dashboards, simulations, app prototypes) should stay\n86: artifact-only. Always follow the user's explicit preference if stated.\n87: \n88: ## Designing Inline Widgets (Cards & Transparency)\n89: \n90: When embedding inline in chat (`<agent-embed>`), style widgets as native chat\n91: components:\n92: \n93: *   **Transparent Root Background**: Always set `<body class=\"bg-transparent\n94:     ...\">` so the widget blends seamlessly into the chat container.\n95: *   **Card-Based Layouts**: Wrap inline content and controls in a card container\n96:     (as shown in the Boilerplate Template above) to provide elevation and\n97:     prevent loose text in light mode.\n98: *   **Standalone Artifacts**: For full-page side-pane artifacts (like\n99:     dashboards), use a solid background (e.g., `bg-[var(--background)]`).\n100: "}
{"step_index":221,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-24T15:45:33Z","input_tokens":4243,"cache_read_tokens":170938,"output_tokens":18019,"thinking":"The interactive HTML artifact generation seems relevant to the reported display issue, potentially impacting how the search and filter bar renders. Examining the referenced TypeScript and HTML files will likely reveal the root cause of the jammed display.\n\n\nThe display issue appears to stem from horizontal overflow within the client list component, specifically within the search and filter bar container. The combined width of the search input and numerous filter elements likely exceeds the available viewport width on typical screens. This leads to the tabs being pushed out of view. The table's horizontal clipping suggests overly wide column widths, also contributing to the right-side content truncation.\n\n\nA two-row layout for the control header should prevent overflow by separating the search bar and filter pills.  This will ensure all filter options are always visible. Adjusting table column widths and employing compact icon buttons for actions will keep the table content within the container's bounds even on smaller screens. The `whitespace-nowrap` attribute will also prevent text wrapping in action column.\n\n\nHorizontal scrolling will be integrated into the table to accommodate narrower screens, alongside responsive column width adjustments. Table column widths will be optimized for content: compact avatars for \"Socio,\" single-click pills for \"Contacto,\" and concise plan/status information. An \"Ver Todos\" shortcut and a \"Mostrar todos los socios\" banner will ensure clear member list visibility management. An HTML artifact and corresponding files will be updated to reflect the table and component structure changes.\n\n\nA responsive grid layout will be used for KPI cards and table columns. The controls bar will be separated into two rows to prevent overflow issues. Specifically, the action button icons will be styled compactly to ensure all six actions fit within a defined width and remain visible.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"import React, { useState, useMemo } from 'react';\nimport { useGym } from '../../context/GymContext';\nimport { Client, MembershipPlanType } from '../../types';\nimport { getGymAvatar, getOfflineGymSvgAvatar, detectGender } from '../../utils/genderAvatar';\nimport { exportClientsToExcel } from '../../utils/excelExport';\nimport { sounds } from '../../services/audio';\n\n// Modals\nimport { ClientFormModal } from './ClientFormModal';\nimport { ClientEditModal } from './ClientEditModal';\nimport { ClientDetailModal } from './ClientDetailModal';\nimport { BiometricEnrollModal } from './BiometricEnrollModal';\nimport { RenewMembershipModal } from './RenewMembershipModal';\nimport { ClientCredentialModal } from './ClientCredentialModal';\n\nimport { \n  Users, \n  UserPlus, \n  Search, \n  Fingerprint, \n  RefreshCw, \n  Eye, \n  Trash2, \n  Phone, \n  Mail, \n  Pencil, \n  LayoutGrid, \n  List, \n  ChevronRight,\n  Download,\n  CheckCircle2,\n  AlertTriangle,\n  Clock,\n  Award,\n  Crown,\n  Share2,\n  QrCode,\n  DoorOpen,\n  ArrowUpDown,\n  Filter,\n  X,\n  Sparkles,\n  Zap,\n  Activity,\n  Calendar,\n  MessageCircle,\n  ShieldCheck,\n  Flame,\n  Check,\n  AlertCircle,\n  Maximize2\n} from 'lucide-react';\n\nexport const ClientList: React.FC = () => {\n  const { \n    members, \n    deleteMember, \n    currentRole, \n    verifyBiometricAccess,\n    todayCheckInsCount,\n    activeBranch \n  } = useGym();\n\n  // Filters & Search\n  const [search, setSearch] = useState('');\n  const [statusFilter, setStatusFilter] = useState<'all' | 'active' | 'expiring_soon' | 'expired' | 'no_fingerprint'>('all');\n  const [tierFilter, setTierFilter] = useState<string>('all');\n  const [sortBy, setSortBy] = useState<'urgency' | 'checkins' | 'name' | 'recent'>('urgency');\n  const [viewMode, setViewMode] = useState<'table' | 'grid' | 'desk'>('table');\n\n  // Modals state\n  const [showAddModal, setShowAddModal] = useState(false);\n  const [selectedClientForDetail, setSelectedClientForDetail] = useState<Client | null>(null);\n  const [selectedClientForEdit, setSelectedClientForEdit] = useState<Client | null>(null);\n  const [selectedClientForEnroll, setSelectedClientForEnroll] = useState<Client | null>(null);\n  const [selectedClientForRenew, setSelectedClientForRenew] = useState<Client | null>(null);\n  const [selectedClientForCredential, setSelectedClientForCredential] = useState<Client | null>(null);\n\n  // Live Toast for Quick Turnstile / Access Test\n  const [accessToast, setAccessToast] = useState<{\n    visible: boolean;\n    granted: boolean;\n    clientName: string;\n    message: string;\n  } | null>(null);\n\n  // Quick Turnstile Access Simulator\n  const handleQuickAccessCheck = (e: React.MouseEvent, client: Client) => {\n    e.stopPropagation();\n    const result = verifyBiometricAccess(client.id);\n\n    if (result.granted) {\n      setAccessToast({\n        visible: true,\n        granted: true,\n        clientName: client.fullName,\n        message: `¡Pase Autorizado! Torniquete 1 Abierto • ${client.membership.planName}`,\n      });\n    } else {\n      setAccessToast({\n        visible: true,\n        granted: false,\n        clientName: client.fullName,\n        message: result.reason || 'Acceso denegado: membresía inactiva o vencida',\n      });\n    }\n\n    setTimeout(() => {\n      setAccessToast(null);\n    }, 4000);\n  };\n\n  // One-click WhatsApp message builder\n  const handleSendWhatsApp = (e: React.MouseEvent, client: Client) => {\n    e.stopPropagation();\n    if (!client.phone) return;\n\n    const isExpired = client.membership.status === 'expired' || client.membership.daysRemaining < 0;\n    const isExpiring = client.membership.daysRemaining <= 5 && !isExpired;\n\n    let message = '';\n    if (isExpired) {\n      const daysOverdue = Math.abs(client.membership.daysRemaining);\n      message = `Hola ${client.fullName}! Te saludamos de Legends Pro Gym. Te recordamos que tu membresía (${client.membership.planName}) venció hace ${daysOverdue} días. ¡Te extrañamos entrenando! Puedes pasar a recepción a renovarla y mantener tu condición al máximo.`;\n    } else if (isExpiring) {\n      message = `Hola ${client.fullName}! Te saludamos de Legends Pro Gym. Te recordamos cordialmente que tu membresía (${client.membership.planName}) vence en ${client.membership.daysRemaining} días (${client.membership.endDate}). Puedes renovar en caja con efectivo, tarjeta o transferencia para evitar interrupciones en tu acceso.`;\n    } else {\n      message = `Hola ${client.fullName}! Te saludamos de Legends Pro Gym. Tu membresía (${client.membership.planName}) se encuentra activa y vigente. ¿Tienes alguna duda o solicitud especial en tu entrenamiento? ¡Estamos a tu orden!`;\n    }\n\n    const cleanPhone = client.phone.replace(/\\D/g, '');\n    window.open(`https://wa.me/${cleanPhone}?text=${encodeURIComponent(message)}`, '_blank');\n  };\n\n  // Filter & Sort Logic\n  const filteredMembers = useMemo(() => {\n    return members\n      .filter((member) => {\n        // Search query\n        const q = search.toLowerCase().trim();\n        const matchesSearch = \n          !q ||\n          member.fullName.toLowerCase().includes(q) ||\n          member.documentId.toLowerCase().includes(q) ||\n          member.phone.toLowerCase().includes(q) ||\n          member.id.toLowerCase().includes(q) ||\n          member.email.toLowerCase().includes(q) ||\n          member.membership.planName.toLowerCase().includes(q);\n\n        if (!matchesSearch) return false;\n\n        // Status Filter\n        const isExpired = member.membership.status === 'expired' || member.membership.daysRemaining < 0;\n        const isExpiring = member.membership.daysRemaining <= 5 && !isExpired;\n        const isActive = member.membership.daysRemaining > 5 && !isExpired;\n\n        if (statusFilter === 'active' && !isActive) return false;\n        if (statusFilter === 'expiring_soon' && !isExpiring) return false;\n        if (statusFilter === 'expired' && !isExpired) return false;\n        if (statusFilter === 'no_fingerprint' && member.biometricRegistered) return false;\n\n        // Plan Tier Filter\n        if (tierFilter !== 'all') {\n          const planNameLower = member.membership.planName.toLowerCase();\n          const planType = member.membership.planType;\n          if (tierFilter === 'vip' && planType !== 'vip' && !planNameLower.includes('vip') && !planNameLower.includes('black')) return false;\n          if (tierFilter === 'monthly' && planType !== 'monthly' && !planNameLower.includes('mensual')) return false;\n          if (tierFilter === 'quarterly' && planType !== 'quarterly' && !planNameLower.includes('trimestral')) return false;\n          if (tierFilter === 'daily' && planType !== 'daily' && !planNameLower.includes('día') && !planNameLower.includes('dia') && !planNameLower.includes('pass')) return false;\n        }\n\n        return true;\n      })\n      .sort((a, b) => {\n        if (sortBy === 'urgency') {\n          // Sort by days remaining ascending (expired/expiring first)\n          return a.membership.daysRemaining - b.membership.daysRemaining;\n        }\n        if (sortBy === 'checkins') {\n          return (b.checkInsCount || 0) - (a.checkInsCount || 0);\n        }\n        if (sortBy === 'name') {\n          return a.fullName.localeCompare(b.fullName);\n        }\n        if (sortBy === 'recent') {\n          return (b.createdAt || '').localeCompare(a.createdAt || '');\n        }\n        return 0;\n      });\n  }, [members, search, statusFilter, tierFilter, sortBy]);\n\n  // Counts for KPI Summary\n  const totalCount = members.length;\n  const activeCount = members.filter(m => m.membership.daysRemaining > 5 && m.membership.status !== 'expired').length;\n  const expiringCount = members.filter(m => m.membership.daysRemaining <= 5 && m.membership.daysRemaining >= 0 && m.membership.status !== 'expired').length;\n  const expiredCount = members.filter(m => m.membership.status === 'expired' || m.membership.daysRemaining < 0).length;\n  const noFingerprintCount = members.filter(m => !m.biometricRegistered).length;\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"space-y-4 sm:space-y-5 w-full\">\n      \n      {/* Dynamic Access Test Toast */}\n      {accessToast && (\n        <div className={`fixed top-4 right-4 z-50 p-4 rounded-2xl border shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md max-w-md animate-fade-in flex items-start gap-3 ${\n          accessToast.granted \n            ? 'bg-[#0b1d14]/95 border-emerald-500/60 shadow-emerald-500/20 text-white' \n            : 'bg-[#21090a]/95 border-red-500/60 shadow-red-500/20 text-white'\n        }`}>\n          <div className={`p-2 rounded-xl shrink-0 ${\n            accessToast.granted ? 'bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400' : 'bg-red-500/20 text-red-400'\n          }`}>\n            {accessToast.granted ? <CheckCircle2 className=\"w-5 h-5\" /> : <AlertCircle className=\"w-5 h-5\" />}\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"flex-1 min-w-0\">\n            <h4 className=\"font-extrabold text-sm flex items-center justify-between\">\n              <span>{accessToast.clientName}</span>\n              <span className=\"text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded uppercase tracking-wider bg-black/40\">\n                {accessToast.granted ? 'CONCEDIDO' : 'DENEGADO'}\n              </span>\n            </h4>\n            <p className=\"text-xs text-zinc-300 mt-0.5 leading-snug\">{accessToast.message}</p>\n          </div>\n          <button \n            onClick={() => setAccessToast(null)} \n            className=\"text-zinc-400 hover:text-white p-1\"\n          >\n            <X className=\"w-4 h-4\" />\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      )}\n\n      {/* 1. TOP HEADER BANNER */}\n      <div className=\"relative bg-gradient-to-r from-[#14151c] via-[#101117] to-[#161722] p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-3xl border border-gym-border shadow-xl overflow-hidden\">\n        {/* Ambient subtle glow background */}\n        <div className=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none -mr-20 -mt-20\" />\n        <div className=\"absolute bottom-0 left-1/3 w-64 h-64 bg-emerald-500/5 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none\" />\n\n        <div className=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n          <div className=\"min-w-0 flex-1\">\n            <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\">\n              <div className=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-400 to-amber-600 flex items-center justify-center text-black font-black shadow-glow-gold shrink-0\">\n                <Users className=\"w-5 h-5\" />\n              </div>\n              <div className=\"min-w-0\">\n                <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap\">\n                  <h1 className=\"text-lg sm:text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-wide uppercase truncate\">\n                    Cartera de Clientes & Membresías\n                  </h1>\n                  <span className=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/15 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-400 text-[10px] font-black tracking-widest uppercase\">\n                    CLUB PRO\n                  </span>\n                </div>\n                <p className=\"text-xs text-gym-muted mt-0.5 truncate\">\n                  Expedientes, vigencias en vivo, credenciales QR y torniquetes biométricos.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            {/* Hardware & Live Status Pills */}\n            <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-2.5 flex-wrap text-xs\">\n              <span className=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-400 font-bold text-[11px]\">\n                <span className=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse\"></span>\n                <span>Torniquetes Biométricos Online (ZKTeco & RFID)</span>\n              </span>\n\n              <span className=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-xl bg-zinc-800/80 border border-zinc-700 text-zinc-300 font-semibold font-mono text-[11px]\">\n                <Activity className=\"w-3 h-3 text-amber-400\" />\n                <span>{todayCheckInsCount} Asistencias Hoy</span>\n              </span>\n\n              {activeBranch && (\n                <span className=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-xl bg-black/40 border border-white/10 text-zinc-400 text-[11px]\">\n                  <span>Sede:</span>\n                  <strong className=\"text-zinc-200\">{activeBranch.name}</strong>\n                </span>\n              )}\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Action buttons */}\n          <div className=\"flex items-center gap-2 w-full sm:w-auto justify-end shrink-0\">\n            <button\n              onClick={() => exportClientsToExcel(filteredMembers)}\n              className=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-gym-surface hover:bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-200 hover:text-white border border-gym-border text-xs font-bold transition-all shadow-sm\"\n              title=\"Descargar padrón de clientes a Excel (.xlsx)\"\n            >\n              <Download className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-400\" />\n              <span>Exportar Excel</span>\n            </button>\n\n            {currentRole !== 'trainer' && (\n              <button\n                onClick={() => setShowAddModal(true)}\n                className=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-amber-400 hover:from-amber-400 hover:to-amber-300 text-black font-extrabold text-xs shadow-glow-gold transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0\"\n              >\n                <UserPlus className=\"w-4 h-4 stroke-[3]\" />\n                <span>Nuevo Cliente</span>\n              </button>\n            )}\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* 2. KPI CARDS GRID */}\n      <div className=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-2.5 sm:gap-3\">\n        \n        {/* Total Cartera */}\n        <div \n          onClick={() => setStatusFilter('all')}\n          className={`relative p-3.5 rounded-2xl border cursor-pointer transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden ${\n            statusFilter === 'all' \n              ? 'bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/20 via-[#181922] to-[#12131a] border-amber-500 ring-2 ring-amber-500/30 shadow-glow-gold/20' \n              : 'bg-gym-card/90 hover:bg-[#161720] border-gym-border hover:border-zinc-600'\n          }`}\n        >\n          <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-gym-muted mb-0.5 font-semibold\">\n            <span>Total Cartera</span>\n            <Users className=\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-400 opacity-80\" />\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"flex items-baseline gap-1.5\">\n            <span className=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-white\">{totalCount}</span>\n            <span className=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-zinc-400 font-mono\">socios</span>\n          </div>\n          <p className=\"text-[10px] text-zinc-400 mt-0.5 truncate\">\n            {activeCount} vigentes ({totalCount ? Math.round((activeCount / totalCount) * 100) : 0}%)\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Activos Vigentes */}\n        <div \n          onClick={() => setStatusFilter('active')}\n          className={`relative p-3.5 rounded-2xl border cursor-pointer transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden ${\n            statusFilter === 'active' \n              ? 'bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/20 via-[#131c17] to-[#0e1411] border-emerald-500 ring-2 ring-emerald-500/30 shadow-glow-green/20' \n              : 'bg-gym-card/90 hover:bg-[#131a15] border-gym-border hover:border-emerald-500/40'\n          }`}\n        >\n          <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-emerald-400 mb-0.5 font-bold\">\n            <span>Activos Vigentes</span>\n            <CheckCircle2 className=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400\" />\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"flex items-baseline gap-1.5\">\n            <span className=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-emerald-400\">{activeCount}</span>\n            <span className=\"text-[9px] font-extrabold uppercase px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300\">\n              Pase OK\n            </span>\n          </div>\n          <p className=\"text-[10px] text-emerald-400/80 mt-0.5 truncate\">\n            Acceso libre al torniquete\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Por Vencer (<= 5 días) */}\n        <div \n          onClick={() => setStatusFilter('expiring_soon')}\n          className={`relative p-3.5 rounded-2xl border cursor-pointer transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden ${\n            statusFilter === 'expiring_soon' \n              ? 'bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/25 via-[#221c11] to-[#17130a] border-amber-500 ring-2 ring-amber-500/40 shadow-glow-gold/25' \n              : 'bg-gym-card/90 hover:bg-[#1f1a10] border-gym-border hover:border-amber-500/40'\n          }`}\n        >\n          <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-amber-400 mb-0.5 font-bold\">\n            <span className=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n              <span>Por Vencer (&le; 5 d)</span>\n              {expiringCount > 0 && <span className=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-400 animate-pulse\"></span>}\n            </span>\n            <Clock className=\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-400\" />\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"flex items-baseline gap-1.5\">\n            <span className=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-amber-400\">{expiringCount}</span>\n            <span className=\"text-[9px] font-extrabold uppercase px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300\">\n              Urgente\n            </span>\n          </div>\n          <p className=\"text-[10px] text-amber-400/80 mt-0.5 truncate\">\n            Requieren aviso de renovación\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Vencidos / Morosos */}\n        <div \n          onClick={() => setStatusFilter('expired')}\n          className={`relative p-3.5 rounded-2xl border cursor-pointer transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden ${\n            statusFilter === 'expired' \n              ? 'bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500/20 via-[#221113] to-[#170a0c] border-red-500 ring-2 ring-red-500/30 shadow-glow-red/20' \n              : 'bg-gym-card/90 hover:bg-[#1c0f11] border-gym-border hover:border-red-500/40'\n          }`}\n        >\n   